stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Warm : prefill() at boot
    Warm --> Claimed : claim(session_id)
    Claimed --> Restoring : blob tar exists
    Restoring --> Active : untar into /workspace
    Claimed --> Active : first turn, nothing to restore
    Active --> Snapshotting : step finished
    Snapshotting --> Idle : tar -> MinIO
    Idle --> Active : next turn, same session_id
    Idle --> Expired : idle > cooldown
    Active --> Lost : host fault / container removed
    Lost --> Claimed : next turn rehydrates
    Expired --> [*] : container removed, pool refilled
    note right of Snapshotting
      The sandbox is a cache.
      Mongo + MinIO hold the record,
      so every exit costs one rehydration.
    end note
